  "projectUrl": "https://pwfauth.com/",
  "published": "2026-10-02T14:59:14.167Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- RegisterAccountWithKeyAsync(username, password, licenseKey, email): create an account with a license key; the account gets the key's time and device limit and the key is used up.\n- RedeemKeyAsync(username, password, licenseKey) and RedeemKeyAsync(licenseKey) for the signed-in account: add a key's time to an account, also after it has expired.\n- New PwfErrorCodes: KeyRequired, KeyAlreadyUsed, KeyInUse, KeyRedeemed, AlreadyLifetime, UsernameExists.\n- Every request sends User-Agent: PWFAuth-dotnet/1.3.0 (+https://pwfauth.com).\nFull history: https://github.com/pwfauth/pwfauth-dotnet/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
